Is the pattern changing over time?

Exploring many series

Which strongly seasonal series peak in Q2?

tourism |&gt;
  features(Trips, feat_stl) |&gt;
  filter(
    seasonal_strength_year &gt; 0.6,
    format(seasonal_peak_year) == "Q2"
  ) |&gt;
  select(Region, Purpose, seasonal_peak_year)

# A tibble: 1 × 3
  Region         Purpose seasonal_peak_year
  &lt;chr&gt;          &lt;chr&gt;   &lt;mixtime&gt;         
1 Blue Mountains Holiday Q2                





tourism |&gt;
  filter(Region == "Blue Mountains") |&gt;
  filter(Purpose == "Holiday") |&gt;
  model(STL(Trips)) |&gt;
  components() |&gt;
  gg_subseries(season_year, period = years(1L))
















The Q2 peak (autumn, Easter?) is growing since 2010.
Q4 is weakening, and is now the trough.

